  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This dataset contains Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping products for activation EMSR934. On 09 October at 17:56 UTC (12:56 Local Time) Panama was struck by a 7.7M earthquake. The epicentre was 12 km west-southwest of Pitaloza Arriba, Panama (inland). Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping was requested to provide earthquake damage assessment emergency mapping. GDACS ID: EQ1570339. **Citation:** Copernicus Emergency Management Service (© 2026 European Union), EMSR934 **Product types present in this dataset's resources:** **GRA (Grading)**: assesses damage to individual features (eg. buildings, infrastructure). Where a GeoPackage download is available for an Area of Interest/round, it already contains every layer with its official Copernicus styling and colours - prefer it in GIS software over the zipped shapefile download."
  ],
